<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/12/msa@/~cl_5> <https://schema.org/text> "Subperenggan 141e(c)(iii) Akta ibu dipinda dengan menggantikan perkataan “the Sales Tax Act 1972 [Act 64] or the Service Tax Act 1975 [Act 151]” dengan perkataan “the Sales Tax Act 2018 [Act ] or the Service Tax Act 2018, or the repealed Sales Tax Act 1972 [Act 64], Service Tax Act 1975 [Act 151] or Goods and Services Tax Act 2014 [Act 762]”. Penggantian seksyen 141f"@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/12/msa@> .
